OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hub to cost council
OL,4,A#233k a year to run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community building being constructed
OL,7,Fin Catterick Garrison would cost
OL,8,F#233,000 to run each year if taken over
OL,9,Fby the council, a report has found.
OL,11,FWhen opened, the Catterick Community
OL,12,Fand Enterprise Building will provide
OL,13,Ffacilities including business start-up
OL,14,Fspace, a community kitchen, training
OL,15,Fopportunities and community event and
OL,16,Factivity space.
