OL,3,GNEWSACommunity hub to cost council
OL,4,A#233k a year to run
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Council's executive
OL,7,Fwill be asked next week to approve an
OL,8,Fin-house operating model for the
OL,9,Fcentre, which is due to open in
OL,10,FFebruary, rather than an external
OL,11,Foperator.
OL,13,FHowever, a report to be considered by
OL,14,Fcouncillors has revealed there was
OL,15,Fcurrently no budget to run the centre,
OL,16,Flocated in the Shute Road and
OL,17,FCoronation Park area.
